-- ============================================================
-- SEED DATA FROM dataset.xlsx FOR POSTGRESQL
-- Generated from dataset(1).xlsx
-- Target: current application schema described in DATABASE_SCHEMA(1).md
--
-- Notes:
-- 1) Uses dataset source identifiers to resolve UUID foreign keys.
-- 2) Excel currency "VNĐ" is normalized to "VND".
-- 3) Interaction campaign_id value "1583" is treated as NULL because
--    it does not exist in Campaigns and represents missing campaign data.
-- 4) CustomerAnalytics RecencyDays / AvgPurchaseCycleDays contain #NAME?
--    in Excel, so behavior history is recalculated from valid Orders.
-- 5) Phase-1 Potential Score is imported from CustomerAnalytics.
-- 6) Script is intended to be rerunnable where practical.
-- ============================================================

